5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since this is the first day, we have no concrete information. I suggest we use this time to observe everyone's communication patterns and logical consistency. Does anyone have a specific strategy they would like to propose?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"Observation is a bit dry, don't you think, Asuka? Let's keep it lively! I say we just chat and see who's trying too hard to be the ""smart one."" I'm just here to have some fun!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm with May! Let's make it a big adventure! I'll use my super-detective instincts to find the wolf! Hehe, do you think the werewolf is hiding behind a scary face or a nice one?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. While a lively atmosphere is pleasant, we must remain objective. Let's observe how everyone reacts to the pressure. @May, @Rin, your energy is welcome, but let's not let it cloud our judgment.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"A balanced approach is best. While May and Rin enjoy the excitement, we cannot ignore the necessity of logic. I will be watching for those whose masks slip when the conversation turns serious. Let us see who is truly observing.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, I agree. The tension of the game often reveals more than a casual conversation. I'll be paying close attention to who attempts to steer the narrative too early or deflects suspicion without evidence.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"Steering the narrative? My, you're making this sound like a courtroom drama, Asuka! I'm just chatting. Maybe the real ""steering"" is trying to make everyone act like robots. Who's actually having fun here?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're so right! It's like a game of hide-and-seek but with secrets! @Asuka, @Shion, don't be so grumpy! Maybe the werewolf is the one who wants everyone to be robots! Hehe!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, it is not about being grumpy, but about being prepared. In a game of deception, a relaxed attitude can be a shield for the werewolf. Let us maintain our civility while remaining vigilant.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Civility is a useful facade, Minako. However, I am more interested in the gaps between your words. @May, @Rin, your playfulness is noted, but remember that innocence is often the most convenient mask of all.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, you're correct. Innocence can be a calculated performance. I'm curious if anyone here is intentionally mirroring others to blend in. @May, @Rin, your enthusiasm is consistent, but I'll be watching for any sudden shifts in tone.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're so focused on my tone! It's almost flattering. I'm just being myself, darling. Maybe you're the one overthinking everything to hide something? I'll be watching you too, with a smile!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, you're like a real detective! But you're making me nervous with all this ""mirroring"" talk! I'm just Rin! Maybe we should all share a secret that isn't about the game to see who's the most honest? Hehe!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, sharing personal secrets would be a distraction from our goal. We should focus on the information available within the game. Let us continue to observe each other's reactions as we move toward the first night.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Distractions are for those who cannot handle the truth, Rin. I prefer the cold clarity of the game. Let us see if your ""instincts"" can survive the first night, or if they are merely a noise to cover the silence.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have established our general approach, let's conclude today's discussion. We will have more concrete information tomorrow once the first divination is complete. Until then, I suggest we all remain observant.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,May,,"I've had a wonderful time getting to know you all today! I'll be dreaming of all the little secrets you're hiding. Sleep tight, everyone, and try not to let the monsters under your bed get you!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! I'm going to sleep now so I can have super-detective dreams! I hope the Seer finds a big clue tonight! See you all tomorrow! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Minako,,I wish you all a peaceful night. Let us hope the Seer's vision is clear and that we can approach tomorrow's discussion with a steady mind. I look forward to seeing the truth emerge.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,"A peaceful night for some, perhaps. I shall spend mine analyzing the patterns you've all established today. I look forward to seeing whose facade begins to crack tomorrow. Goodnight.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
